TAILED BEAST SIGHTINGS AND STATUS REPORT
Intelligence Division — Restricted

Konoha maintains awareness of the nine tailed beasts and their
jinchuriki hosts as a matter of strategic priority, given the Akatsuki
extraction campaign.

Status Notes:
- Nine-Tails (Kurama): sealed within Naruto Uzumaki of the Leaf.
  Protective posture active.
- One-Tail (Shukaku): host is the Kazekage of Sunagakure. Reported
  Akatsuki attack; see allied liaison channels.
- Eight-Tails: host resides in Kumogakure; Cloud reports attempted
  Akatsuki approach.
- Remaining beasts: hosts distributed across the great and minor
  villages; several reported captured by Akatsuki cells.

Assessment: The extraction campaign is advancing. Loss of a host
appears to result in the host's death during extraction. Any sighting
of a large-scale chakra manifestation is to be reported at once, with
no independent engagement below Jonin authority.
